ent, persistent and non actionable communication. Inline alert includes functional"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"icon and semantic colour, and does not include a close button and\/or action link. Inline alert does not disappear and remains visible."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOInlineAlert","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"doc://MISOComponents/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertMessage":{"title":"MISOAlertMessage","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertMessage","abstract":[{"text":"Alert message is a UI element that displays system feedback, status changes or required action; throughout detailed, prominent, persistent and actionable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"communication. Alert message includes functional icon and semantic colour, and may include as well a close button and\/or action link.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Alert Message does not disappear automatically and remains visible until dismissed or resolved by the user.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOAlertMessage","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misoalertmessage","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOAlertMessage","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOAlertStatus":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOAlertStatus","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The status of the alerts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MI